sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as user
  participant A as api
  participant T as totp service
  participant P as postgres
  U->>A: POST /mfa/enrol
  A->>T: generate secret
  T-->>A: secret + otpauth URI
  A->>P: store secret (encrypted)
  A-->>U: QR + manual key
  U->>A: POST /mfa/verify (code)
  A->>T: verify code (HMAC-SHA1, 30s, 1 step drift)
  T-->>A: ok / replay / wrong
  alt accepted
    A->>P: mark enrolled, store last step
    A-->>U: recovery codes (hashed, single use)
  else attempt limit exceeded
    A-->>U: 429 within window
  end
  Note over A,P: enrolment refuses to start when the encryption key is missing
